WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:07.020
All right, we've said thanks to La Folia for
everything. We finally can return to Itogami Island.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:14.260
How strange. Although we were with Kojou, we came back from
the Aldegyr Kingdom business trip without any strange accidents.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:20.340
Yes, I was also prepared to deal with terrorism.
After all, we are with with Akatsuki-senpai.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.590
Am I a jinx or what?

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.280
Yo! We meet again, boy.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:27.110
Again?

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:32.460
You have really cute girls with you!
Who's your girlfriend? All of them?

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:34.690
All of them... How is that possible?

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:38.760
Eh?! You really look cute, I like you!

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:42.990
Excuse me, are you two going
to Itogami Island?

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:49.020
You guys too, right?
By the way, my name is Ki, Ki Juranbarada.

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:52.990
My name is Akatsuki Kojou.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:01:00.140
I'm looking forward seeing you on Itogami Island. I've
heard there's a lot of fun events over there.

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:02.910
Ki, he's coming this way!

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:06.770
See you Akatsuki Kojou. Have a good trip.

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:13.860
What was that?!

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:48.390
You can't get in touch with Itogami Island?
What do you mean?

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:55.540
I don't know, but it's not just the internet that is having problems.
I can't use the satellite phone or the my family's private line.

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:59.440
So it's not an ordinary problem, like
a broken submarine cable.

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:03.070
In other words, it's possible something
happened to Itogami Island?

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:06.270
Sadly, it's quite possible.

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:07.670
What?!

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:12.140
I thought nothing happened at Aldegyr,
but we came back to this?!

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:15.680
Senpai, Akatsuki-senpai! Please come!
Nagisa-chan is...

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.360
What happened, Nagisa?!

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:26.760
Kojou-kun. I'm scared, Kojou-kun! I feel like
negative emotions are accumulating on Itogami Island.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:31.970
Murderous intent, madness...
It's like a war has begun.

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:34.280
War on Itogami Island?!

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:39.480
Don't go, Kojou-kun! If you return to Itogami Island...

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:42.860
Senpai, just now was...

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:47.720
This happened before...she experiences visions,
then passes out.

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:51.040
We've almost arrived.

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:55.690
Although we can't communicate with air traffic
control, the pilot will use visual flight rules.

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:58.990
We'll land at the Coast Guard airbase
on the southern part of the island.

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:00.850
Visual flight rules?

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:07.420
All right! Anyways, the only way is
to return to Itogami Island.

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:19.930
It's useless. It seems that cellphone
providers are all dead.

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:22.110
Even lighting is weak.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:25.850
Senpai, what should we do next?

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:33.480
After all, this was an illegal landing. Normally,
the Coast Guard would've come already.

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:36.880
Kojou-kun! Look at that!

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:40.080
Senpai! They are...

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.250
Demons.

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:49.480
What?! It's just a bunch of kids?!
Did you go on a school trip?

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:53.560
Well, forget it, I welcome you.

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:57.830
I am Mark Ugaki, the ruler of the Ugaki domain.

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:01.960
Kids, you all must become my followers!

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:04.150
Huh?! Ugaki domain?

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:06.830
You don't know since you were abroad?!

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:09.310
Domain's are territories that had
been assigned to us.

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:13.730
As long as you become my followers,
we'll protect you from other domains.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:18.090
So...In other words, it's just gangsters
fighting for territory?

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:21.960
Are gang leaders trying to control
territory on Itogami Island?

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:23.930
Who did you call the gangsters?

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:25.710
Are these brats underestimating Ugaki-san?!

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:27.960
No matter how you look at it,
you look like gangsters!

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.550
Your clothes and attitude say it all.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:32.550
What did you say, bitch?!

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:41.040
Well, it doesn't matter if you don't want to become
my followers, but that means you are my enemies.

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:43.820
I won't show mercy, even if it's a kid.

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:51.950
What's with this guy?!

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:56.520
A giant with the ability to transform,
he's a troll.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:06:01.150
They have a strong body and the ability to
regenerate. They're said to be a warlike race.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:04.730
That's all?!

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:06.090
Eh... Yes.

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:11.070
What are you talking about?
Behold my power!

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:15.910
As expected of Ugaki-san!

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:19.380
You understand now?!

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:23.480
It sure is impressive, but doesn't your hand hurt like that?

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.230
Don't underestimate me, asshole.

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:30.080
Now I'm going to show you how scary this
Ugaki-sama cane be!

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:35.580
What's that magic?

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:37.200
It's ritual magic.

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:41.350
The magic power of his followers are
flowing into him thanks to the spell.

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:44.310
That's why he's gathering more followers?!

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:51.850
In other words, the more followers he has,
the more magic power he can use.

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:56.360
I see. I roughly understand.
Himeragi, I'm counting on you.

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:57.060
Yes!

00:06:58.340 --> 00:06:59.310
Sekkarou!

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:03.700
Hey-hey, with a spear like that...

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:12.440
We are tired from the long journey. I'm
sorry, but I'll try to make this quick.

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:19.060
Wait-wait a minute! What's with that much
magical power?! Who the hell are you?!

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:21.060
Come, Al-Nasl Minium!

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:30.440
Well, this should be enough for now.

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:32.480
Kojou-kun, look!

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:45.790
The Keystone Gate...?
It was...destroyed...?!

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:51.900
While we were away, what happened on Itogami Island?

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:55.470
Well, this...even if you ask me what happened...

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:59.180
When was the Keystone Gate destroyed? Who did it?

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:01.720
Ah! That was the Fourth Primogenitor.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:02.260
Huh?

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:03.950
I didn't lie to you, brother.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:07.750
Who are you calling "brother"? More
than that, tell us in detail what happened.

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:14.740
The night before yesterday, Keystone Gate was
attacked. They called themselves Order the End.

00:08:14.780 --> 00:08:16.240
Order the End?

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:22.640
They're a group of guys wearing disgusting looking masks.

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:27.160
They say they've served the true Fourth Primogenitor
from ancient times to the present day.

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:30.810
The true Fourth Primogenitor...I don't like the sound of that...

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:33.400
What is the Island Guard doing?

00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:36.390
It is said that they were completely...
destroyed!

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:37.480
Completely destroyed?

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:42.550
With only the power of 3 people... Even the
City Management System was taken over.

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:50.470
This is the evidence: With this you have the right to
contract to followers. They were given to all demons.

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:55.920
As the number of followers increase, the magic power of
the Lord candidate will also grow stronger.

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:59.430
So that's why you tried to force us to join before?

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:07.540
In the beginning, it was just like a game, but after a while,
things escalated as people started killing each other.

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:12.840
Since the registration cards had been hacked into,
it's no doubt they've got the system under their control.

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:17.860
The guys called Order the End, in the end,
what did they want you to do?

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.780
Lords' War.

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:20.700
What?

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:22.310
The Lord candidates need to fight each other,

00:09:22.334 --> 00:09:29.200
and the person who unified all the domains will replace
the Fourth Primogenitor as the Lord of Itogami island.

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:35.740
Right now there are about 80 Lord candidates
whose domain divides Itogami Island.

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:39.760
To replace the Fourth Primogenitor? And who was
the one who decided that sort of thing?

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:41.550
The Fourth Primogenitor.

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:42.500
Huh?!

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:47.900
That's the truth! Please turn on the TV!
They are repeating it over and over again.

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:54.120
This is a message for all humans living on Itogami Island, as well as all demons.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:56.190
Why is he...?!

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:57.450
Huh? You know him?!

00:09:57.610 --> 00:09:58.490
He is...

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:01.120
My name is The Blood.

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:08.670
I am the Lord of the Itogami Island Dominion, being the
strongest vampire in the world, known as the Fourth Primogenitor.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:16.420
We met in the deepest part of Karukeri inside Onrai
Island. He probably was the instigator of it.

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:20.040
This guy...?!

00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:22.790
He took advantage of our situation...

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:31.960
Yeah, hiding Kojou's true identity backfired on us. Though I
didn't expect to be impersonated by an impostor this bold.

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:37.150
Anyway, you know...How long are
you planning on staying here?

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:37.560
Huh?

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:45.630
No, didn't brother just use quite outrageous magic? If
the other domains notice, they won't sit still.

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:47.700
They will come to attack us, right?

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:49.370
Yes, probably.

00:10:49.720 --> 00:10:52.770
Senpai, unfortunately, it's already too late.

00:10:57.340 --> 00:11:01.140
How dangerous!
Those guys are the Federation of Rogues.

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:04.620
Quite a lot had gathered in just two or three days.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:06.810
They still have people left.

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:11.680
There are four domains around this area,
which are all ruled by Beastmen.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:19.350
They already defeated many of the Lord candidates nearby.
It is said that they now have around 700 followers.

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:21.210
Looks like we're completely surrounded.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:26.840
I don't think we can convince them with words.
What should we do? Should we break through by force?

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:33.460
No, they are Beastmen. Even if it was only me and senpai,
it would be difficult to escape completely.

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:37.950
Damn, what a pain in the ass.
Should I just blow it all up?

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:44.340
Don't! If that troll is telling the truth, they're
also victims of The Blood's manipulation, right?

00:11:45.560 --> 00:11:50.650
He has deceived many unrelated people,
same as on Onrai Island.

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:57.830
Resonant Thunder!

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:04.110
We found it! It's Ugaki!

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:05.470
There are others here!

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:08.970
Damn! Do I really have to blow them away with a familiar?

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:10.620
What happened?

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:12.630
What the heck is this?

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:23.040
It's them.
It's them, Order the End!

00:12:23.230 --> 00:12:24.050
What?!

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.210
What is happening?

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:34.590
Stop it!

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:46.330
Are you Akatsuki Kojou? Successor
to the blood of Kaleid Blood.

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:53.260
We are Order the End, those who have served
the true Fourth Primogenitor since ancient times.

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:59.820
In order to lead you to believe your role as the King,
it is our duty to lead you to your true awakening.

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:03.510
Are you making this stupid farce for me?
Don't joke with me!

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:05.510
I didn't joke with you.

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:11.570
You are...The Blood!

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:17.020
This is the first time we've met in person, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:13:17.240 --> 00:13:25.770
I would've liked to speak with you slowly...but it's
still to early. The Lords' War has only just begun!

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:29.620
This magic...

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:32.860
Come, Regulus Aurum!

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:37.360
Show up, Primus Aurum!

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:06.580
The Blood...who the hell are you?

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:18.740
Himeragi, where are you?

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.300
Yaze!  Asagi!

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:26.510
Nagisa! Kanase...answer me, please!

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:29.420
Damn!

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:32.690
Onii-san?
Onii-san, is that you?

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:33.740
Kanase!

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:39.240
Are you okay, Kanase?

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:43.420
Yes. I'm fine. But...

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:45.670
Ugaki!

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:50.600
Pull yourself together. What happened to
your ability to regenerate?

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:58.140
No...After losing this much blood, I can't really do anything.
All my companions also ran away.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:01.700
Damn, the ambulance...can't be called either.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.540
Wait, I'll take you to the hospital right away.

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:09.220
As expected of brother.

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:11.340
Onii-san!

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:21.600
Are you a participant in the Lords' War?
Are you a Lord candidate?

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:26.640
This guy is, we're just passerby.
What about you guys?

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:29.040
We are the War Management Committee.

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:33.640
A neutral organization in responsible for
managing the Lords' War.

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:37.100
Are you the partners of Order the End?

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:40.720
That's not true, we're the staff of M.A.R.

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:41.830
Huh?!

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:48.540
We're commissioned to support clothing, water and food
distribution, and also to provide rescue to the injured.

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:51.020
Checking the demon registration card as well.

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:54.270
M.A.R? Who's your leader?

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:55.590
That's a corporate secret.

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:04.960
Checkup is complete. Mark Ugaki, leader
of domain with 57 followers. Race: Troll.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:07.740
Do you accept leaving the Lords' War?

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:09.740
Yes.

00:16:13.760 --> 00:16:20.460
Brother, I'm counting on you. Please
become the true Lord of Itogami Island.

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:23.360
Brother, I know you can do it.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:24.310
Yeah...

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:28.210
Can you protect this girl too?

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:32.240
According to our contract, we can't
accept such a request.

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:37.430
If you don't have enough confidence to
protect her, ask a Lord candidate to do it.

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:40.360
Hey! Wait a second!

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:45.510
I want to be with you, Onii-san.
Until death do us part.

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:47.850
Ah, no...that's...

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:53.360
All right, let's look for Nagisa and the others together.

00:16:53.810 --> 00:16:57.890
After all, we don't know how much we can
believe the War Management Committee.

00:17:03.340 --> 00:17:05.860
Onii-san, there is a wolf there!

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:07.430
Huh? A wolf?

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:10.000
It's Himeragi's shikigami.

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:16.790
Sorry, Kanase. Please bear with me
for a little bit. Don't let go of my hand.

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:18.090
Yes!

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:22.030
Please, be safe.

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:24.880
Ahh, I feel so refreshed.

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:30.020
What a nice bath, thank you Himeragi-san.
And thanks for the clothes as well.

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:34.720
No, I survived from drowning because
Aiba-senpai saved me.

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.420
This was the least I could do.

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:41.150
I really thought I was going to die.
Well, that stupid Kojou.

00:17:42.530 --> 00:17:45.120
Has your next door neighbor...not come back yet?

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:48.780
Well, but it will be alright.

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:51.740
Besides, Kojou can't die even if he's killed.

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:57.670
Because you have protected them, Nagisa-chan,
Kanase-san, and Motoki as well are fine too.

00:17:58.110 --> 00:17:59.650
That's what I hope for, atleast.

00:18:01.450 --> 00:18:06.030
Senpai, that....I'm sorry that...that t-shirt is too small.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:10.840
I'll only wear it until my bra is dry,
so be patient for a bit.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:15.130
No, it's not about patience
or anything like that...It's just...

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:21.620
For now, let's eat first.

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:23.600
Yes!

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:26.800
You don't have to worry too much.

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:31.590
If even we, the weakest ones could survive that,
then everybody else are safe and sound.

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:37.340
Yes, you are right. Yukina-chan, Kanon-chan
and Asagi-chan are all strong.

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:38.330
Yeah.

00:18:38.820 --> 00:18:43.540
Oh, but Yazecchi, you're not weak either.
You saved me, didn't you?

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:45.610
Yeah, that's right.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:47.920
Yazecchi?!

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:49.890
It's bad, they are following us.

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:53.780
They are the survivors of the Federation of Rogues.

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:56.300
But I didn't hear anything.

00:18:56.380 --> 00:19:00.760
That's because my ears are special. It would
be bad if they catch up to us, so let's run.

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:01.260
Yes.

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:13.130
We cannot maintain distance from them.

00:19:13.390 --> 00:19:15.900
Are they following our scent? Damn!

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:19.690
Yazecchi, sorry, I can't...

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:25.930
It's do or die. Let's go back to the
surface. Better than being trapped here.

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:27.200
I understand.

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:35.100
What is this place?

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:36.810
Yazecchi, they're here!

00:19:44.150 --> 00:19:45.450
You are ours!

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:47.430
How dare you hurt our companions!

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:48.790
Kill them!

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:57.010
That's a lot of beastmen for two humans,
you should be ashamed.

00:19:57.120 --> 00:19:58.830
Who the hell are you?!

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:04.550
You entered someone's domain without
being invited. You people really are rude.

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:06.200
Other people's domain?

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:09.870
Tensou Gakkan? Its bad, the lord of this domain is...

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:14.110
The strongest succubus in the world, Lilith!

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:18.100
Damn! We are in trouble, lets escape!

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:21.150
You are the Lord of this domain?!

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:22.660
Yume-chan!

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:25.110
It's been a long time, Nagisa-oneesan!

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:27.050
And you too, man with pointy hair.

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:30.420
Welcome to Tensou Gakkan.

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:32.800
We have finally arrived.

00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:37.690
I hope Akatsuki-senpai will come after us
after seeing the message we left behind.

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:40.940
If you think about it a little bit,
this is the most logical place.

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:44.498
Because there is a workstation to access the
Manmade Island Management Corporation's network here,

00:20:44.522 --> 00:20:48.100
is the reason we chose this school as our goal.

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:53.560
So we first need to check out the
situation and sneak into the school.

00:20:53.740 --> 00:20:55.960
I'll send out Shikigami for scouting.

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:58.060
Aiba-senpai, get down!

00:20:58.970 --> 00:21:01.040
Keep your head down, it's a sniper!

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:03.530
Did they detect the magic?

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:06.220
Could it be the Lord candidate's attack?!

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:07.900
Don't move from here, please.

00:21:10.650 --> 00:21:12.430
Get ready, intruder!

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:13.560
Sekkarou!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.790
They blocked the attack of Hawless?!

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:17.600
Eh?

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:18.750
Eh?

00:21:19.150 --> 00:21:20.560
Kasugaya-san?

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:23.210
Himeragi Yukina, it's you!

00:21:24.060 --> 00:21:25.030
This domain...eh?!

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:29.550
Uhm... what's happening?!

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:32.950
Sup! Welcome back, Cyber Empress!

00:21:34.900 --> 00:21:37.990
Kasugaya domain welcomes you guys.

00:23:15.750 --> 00:23:17.780
Onii-san...

00:23:23.470 --> 00:23:26.170
How did this happen?!
